      <title>中国拒绝G20反对廉价出口声明 直指新能源出口压力</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/trade/post/20260902/%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E6%8B%92%E7%BB%9DG20%E5%8F%8D%E5%AF%B9%E5%BB%89%E4%BB%B7%E5%87%BA%E5%8F%A3%E5%A3%B0%E6%98%8E-%E7%9B%B4%E6%8C%87%E6%96%B0%E8%83%BD%E6%BA%90%E5%87%BA%E5%8F%A3%E5%8E%8B%E5%8A%9B/</link>
